{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfZqXMjMDUz9NRm3uDcWg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! **Command:** `cd ./sample-service && ./mvnw test`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n\n**All 17 tests pass**, including the 9 ShipmentControllerTest tests (5 existing + 4 new ones I added):\n- ✅ `creates a shipment in CREATED status`\n- ✅ `rejects a duplicate shipment id with the error envelope`\n- ✅ `returns a shipment by id`\n- ✅ `reports an unknown shipment through the error envelope`\n- ✅ `lists shipments in id order`\n- ✅ `confirms a created shipment` (NEW)\n- ✅ `confirm is idempotent on already confirmed shipment` (NEW)\n- ✅ `rejects confirm on a cancelled shipment with error envelope` (NEW)\n- ✅ `rejects confirm on unknown shipment with error envelope` (NEW)\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — `./mvnw test` result: BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — 5 existing ShipmentControllerTest tests all pass\n3. ✅ **`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment and persists it** — Test `confirms a created shipment` verifies this; repository.save() is called in the endpoint\n4. ✅ **Error responses consistent with rest of API** — Uses same pattern: throw ApiException subclass (ResourceNotFoundException for 404, ConflictException for 409), caught by GlobalExceptionHandler\n5. ✅ **Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled shipment refused; unknown id refused** — Three separate tests cover these:\n   - `confirm is idempotent on already confirmed shipment` — second confirm succeeds\n   - `rejects confirm on a cancelled shipment with error envelope` — 409 with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS\n   - `rejects confirm on unknown shipment with error envelope` — 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** — Did not touch pom.xml; only used existing Spring/Kotlin dependencies\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file